# FAC-133 control-plane state. SECRET-BEARING — never stage these:
#   .herd/control/mac.secret   HMAC secret (WriteControlMACSecret, every prod dispatch)
#   .herd/brokers/*.ctrl.json  control_token + host_creds ("Bearer $ANTHROPIC_API_KEY", ...)
# The rest is durable runtime state (sealed envelopes, issuer sequence,
# readiness attestation, mailboxes) that is per-machine, never reviewable.
.herd/control/
**/.herd/control/
.herd/brokers/
**/.herd/brokers/
.herd/readiness/
**/.herd/readiness/
.herd/mail.jsonl
